---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ShortTermApplianceRentalIsland from '../components/islands/ShortTermApplianceRentalIsland';

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Short-Term Appliance Rental",
  "description": "Flexible short-term washer and dryer rental in Ocean Springs with free delivery and no long-term commitment required.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/#localbusiness",
    "name": "Sudsy Co. Rentals",
    "telephone": "+1-228-338-3455",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "1302 Fort St",
      "addressLocality": "Ocean Springs",
      "addressRegion": "MS",
      "postalCode": "39564",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Mississippi"
  },
  "url": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/short-term-appliance-rental/",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "price": "59.99",
    "priceCurrency": "USD",
    "priceSpecification": {
      "@type": "UnitPriceSpecification",
      "price": "59.99",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "unitText": "month"
    }
  }
};

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Short-Term Appliance Rental" }
  ]
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Short-Term Appliance Rental Ocean Springs MS | Sudsy Co."
  description="Short-term appliance rental in Ocean Springs, MS. Rent a washer and dryer for weeks or months with free delivery and no credit check. Cancel anytime."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <h1 class="sr-only">Short-Term Appliance Rental in Ocean Springs, MS</h1>
  <ShortTermApplianceRentalIsland client:only="react" />

  <!-- Rich SEO content — server rendered -->
  <section class="bg-muted/30 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: What Makes It "Short-Term"?</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Sudsy Co. rents month-to-month, which means there's no minimum rental period beyond your first month. Stay a month, stay six months — it's up to you. When you're ready to return the machine, call us and we'll come pick it up. No cancellation fees, no questions.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">That flexibility is what makes our service work for the kinds of situations Gulf Coast residents actually deal with.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: When Short-Term Appliance Rental Makes Sense</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Temporary work assignments.</strong> If you're on a 3-6 month contract job on the Gulf Coast, buying appliances you'll have to sell or move just doesn't pencil out. Rent short-term and leave clean.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Military PCS transitions.</strong> Keesler AFB families know the drill — you're here for a year or two, then you're somewhere else entirely. Buying a washer and dryer means moving it or selling it on Facebook Marketplace. Renting short-term means you just call us when orders come.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Laundry room renovations.</strong> If your laundry hookups are getting redone or you're adding a new room, you need a temporary setup while construction is underway. We can put a unit in a secondary space while the work gets done.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Appliance emergencies.</strong> Your washer died and you're waiting on a replacement to ship. That's a 2-3 week window where the laundromat gets expensive fast. A short-term rental bridges that gap.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Seasonal residents.</strong> If you spend fall and winter on the Gulf Coast, a short-term rental covers your stay without any of the headaches of storage or resale.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Pricing for Short-Term Appliance Rental</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">| Plan | Monthly Rate | What's Included | |------|-------------|-----------------| | Basic | $59.99/mo | Standard washer & dryer set |
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Delivery, installation, and pickup are all free. You're billed month-to-month with no setup fees or cancellation charges.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Free Delivery and Installation — Next Day</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We deliver short-term appliance rentals across Jackson County and Harrison County:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Ocean Springs</li>
  <li>Biloxi (including near Keesler AFB)</li>
  <li>Gulfport</li>
  <li>D'Iberville</li>
  <li>Pascagoula</li>
  <li>Gautier</li>
  <li>Long Beach</li>
  <li>Pass Christian</li>
  <li>Moss Point</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call us today and we can usually get a machine out to you by tomorrow.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: No Credit Check, No Commitment</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We don't run credit. We don't require a long lease. You rent from us because it's the practical choice — and we keep it that way with straight month-to-month billing.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Ready to Rent Short-Term?</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call <strong>(228) 338-3455</strong> or <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline">start online</a>. We'll confirm your delivery window and get a machine to you as soon as tomorrow.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Sudsy Co. Washer and Dryer Rentals</strong> Locally owned. Ocean Springs, MS. Mississippi Gulf Coast.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
